ge graph, and deep PDF reading.","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/poco-ai/Agentero/releases/tag/v0.11.2","tags":["academics","agent","article","literature","paper","pdf","reference","research","thesis","zotero"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"Agent 友好的文献管理方式。","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/poco-ai/Agentero/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"传统文献管理器对 Agent 并不友好：阅读高亮和笔记被锁在单篇文件里，Agent 很难跨论文复用；每次对话都要重新提供上下文，缺少稳定的本地知识地图；PDF 对人友好，但对 Agent 来讲不是最舒服的阅读材料。Agentero 旨在构建 Agent 友好、Agent 原生的文献管理方式，探索人与 Agent 在文献管理中的协作方式。通过 ACP 连接本机 Agent（BYOA），支持划词对话、论文导入与 Skill 导入，兼容 Zotero 生态，提供论文翻译、双链与知识图谱、PDF 深度阅读等功能。","name":"Agentero","packageUrl":"https://github.com/poco-ai/Agentero","publisher":"poco-ai","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/poco-ai","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/poco-ai/Agentero/releases/tag/v0.11.2","tags":["agent","pdf","zotero","学术","引用","文献","文献管理","研究","论文"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://github.com/poco-ai","releaseDate":"2026-09-20","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/poco-ai/Agentero/releases/tag/v0.11.2","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.12.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/p/poco-ai/Agentero/0.11.2/poco-ai.Agentero.yaml","sha256":"b456b767683f21a8ff52b8ca6f81f29edc4875f18fe7872e55cd7ffa80e7ae0d"},{"path":"manifests/p/poco-ai/Agentero/0.11.2/poco-ai.Agentero.installer.yaml","sha256":"ea631ebe96dc7ba4851b1601d1c1c535d8d195ad93715ed43acf481173ee329b"},{"path":"manifests/p/poco-ai/Agentero/0.11.2/poco-ai.Agentero.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"b372e45b6cd6302af6cbe0f160bd0777fc304bd1ca3d7e1392905c83114102e6"},{"path":"manifests/p/poco-ai/Agentero/0.11.2/poco-ai.Agentero.locale.zh-CN.yaml","sha256":"bad5e2a7ab3f8afaa43a76b9cb848ed4b3d7474fcf80373045ade75e126847b4"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"0.11.2"}